oes the fleet see in the registration table?
No `P-PR-VIEW-TRUNC` — with the 512-descriptor cap the view is complete. But note the wire says **64** descriptors while `P-PR-PROBE` says **2**: the probe runs at mount before peers register. Also the keys changed across remounts (`0x2d7fac00` → `0x72907e1e`), so `local_key` is a per-incarnation id, not a slot.

